================================================================================

Most TSX components use custom CSS for margins. Some use Tailwind:
  mb-0!, mb-4, mt-2 sm:mt-0, mb-2, mt-4, mb-1, mt-60
  (Found in: Built.tsx, Candidate.tsx, Opportunity.tsx, Global.tsx, 
   Support.tsx, WhoThis.tsx, ForJob.tsx, DetailSection.tsx, HeroSection.tsx)

No consistent convention for when to use Tailwind vs custom CSS for spacing.

