RECOMMENDED ACTIONS (PRIORITY ORDER)
================================================================================

P1 — Create shared CSS utilities:
  - `.hero-para-wrapper` shared class (eliminates 11 duplicates)
  - `.golden-border` shared class (eliminates 15+ duplicates)
  - `.section-content-para` with responsive font sizing (already exists but 
     not used consistently)

P2 — Standardize breakpoint system:
  - Pick either granular (A) or simplified (B) and migrate all files
  - Define breakpoints as CSS custom properties or preprocessor variables

P3 — Fix image sizing:
  - Create a shared `.section-img` class with `width: 100%; height: auto;`
  - Add responsive max-width per breakpoint consistently
  - Use `object-fit` consistently for card images
  - Ensure all `<Image>` components have consistent className patterns

P4 — Standardize vertical spacing:
  - Create CSS variables: --section-padding-y, --card-gap, --hero-margin
  - Use consistently across all page components
  - Migrate all px values to rem/em

P5 — Fix grid responsive breakpoints:
  - all-case-studies-card-wrapper needs a mobile breakpoint
  - Standardize grid column breakpoints across all card wrappers
  - Use consistent breakpoint (600px or 767px or 480px) for mobile stack

P6 — Hero section height standardization:
  - Standardize max-height values across hero sections
  - Currently ranges from 520px to 700px inconsistently
  - Create a utility class for hero section sizing

